# US-B CRYPTO context collector (BTCUSDT, public market data only). Read by the three
# usb-crypto-context units through EnvironmentFile=. No key, token, URL or account here, and
# none may be added: the collector reads no credential and the API answers GET only.
#
# Persistent journal (the authority). Sealed hourly files; retention deletes from here only.
CTX_V1_ROOT=/root/usb_runtime/crypto_context/journal
# Volatile current-state cache. systemd RuntimeDirectory= of usb-crypto-context.service makes
# this a tmpfs directory that is created at start and removed at stop. <root>/state links here.
CTX_V1_STATE_CACHE=/run/usb-crypto-context
# GET-only API, bound to 127.0.0.1. Confirm the port is free on the host before the first start.
CTX_V1_API_PORT=8013
# RETENTION_CTX_V1_1.md: local retention of sealed persistent files.
CTX_V1_RETENTION_DAYS=7
